@startuml GuestViewsChapter
' --- DIAGRAM METADATA ---
title "Sequence Diagram: Guest Views a Chapter"

' --- PARTICIPANTS ---
actor Guest
participant "Frontend (Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "Backend (FastAPI)" as Backend

' --- INITIAL STATE ---
ref over Guest, Frontend, Backend : Guest is on the Subject Detail page

' --- FLOW OF EVENTS ---
Guest -> Frontend: Clicks on a chapter title (e.g., "Introduction to Algorithms")
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Frontend: Navigates to route '/subjects/{subjectId}/chapters/{chapterId}'

Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/chapters/{chapterId}
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: Calls crud.get_chapter_by_id(id=chapterId)
note right of Backend: Fetches the specific chapter details.

Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK [Chapter Object with content]
deactivate Backend

Frontend --> Guest: Renders the Chapter page, displaying the title and content.
deactivate Frontend

@enduml